  92:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_gpio.c **** 
  93:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_gpio.c ****    (#) To get the level of a pin configured in input mode use
